<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="mr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Happy Birthday Mau ❤️</title>

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>

*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;
}

body{
background:#090909;
overflow-x:hidden;
color:white;
scroll-behavior:smooth;
}

body::-webkit-scrollbar{
display:none;
}

.hearts{
position:fixed;
width:100%;
height:100%;
top:0;
left:0;
pointer-events:none;
z-index:1;
overflow:hidden;
}

.heart{
position:absolute;
bottom:-20px;
color:#ff1744;
animation:float 8s linear infinite;
font-size:20px;
opacity:0.7;
}

@keyframes float{
0%{
transform:translateY(0) rotate(0deg);
opacity:0;
}
50%{
opacity:1;
}
100%{
transform:translateY(-100vh) rotate(360deg);
opacity:0;
}
}

.hero{
height:100vh;
display:flex;
justify-content:center;
align-items:center;
text-align:center;
padding:20px;
position:relative;
z-index:2;
background:
linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.7),rgba(0,0,0,0.8)),
url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518199266791-5375a83190b7?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop');
background-size:cover;
background-position:center;
}

.hero-content{
animation:fadeIn 2s ease;
}

.hero h1{
font-size:4rem;
color:#ffd700;
text-shadow:0 0 20px #ffd700;
margin-bottom:20px;
}

.hero p{
font-size:1.3rem;
color:#eee;
margin-bottom:40px;
line-height:2rem;
}

.btn{
padding:15px 40px;
border:none;
border-radius:50px;
background:linear-gradient(45deg,#ff1744,#ff9100);
color:white;
font-size:1rem;
cursor:pointer;
transition:0.4s;
box-shadow:0 0 20px rgba(255,0,80,0.5);
}

.btn:hover{
transform:scale(1.08);
}

.section{
padding:80px 20px;
position:relative;
z-index:2;
}

.title{
text-align:center;
font-size:2.5rem;
margin-bottom:50px;
color:#ffd700;
}

.gallery{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr));
gap:20px;
max-width:1200px;
margin:auto;
}

.gallery img{
width:100%;
height:400px;
object-fit:cover;
border-radius:25px;
transition:0.5s;
border:3px solid rgba(255,215,0,0.3);
box-shadow:0 0 20px rgba(255,215,0,0.15);
}

.gallery img:hover{
transform:scale(1.05);
}

.letter{
max-width:900px;
margin:auto;
padding:40px;
background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
border-radius:30px;
line-height:2.2rem;
font-size:1.1rem;
box-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
}

.timeline{
max-width:800px;
margin:auto;
position:relative;
}

.timeline::before{
content:'';
position:absolute;
left:50%;
width:4px;
height:100%;
background:#ffd700;
transform:translateX(-50%);
}

.timeline-item{
padding:20px 40px;
position:relative;
width:50%;
}

.timeline-item:nth-child(odd){
left:0;
text-align:right;
}

.timeline-item:nth-child(even){
left:50%;
}

.timeline-content{
background:#111;
padding:20px;
border-radius:20px;
border:1px solid rgba(255,215,0,0.2);
box-shadow:0 0 20px rgba(255,215,0,0.1);
}

.cards{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));
gap:20px;
max-width:1100px;
margin:auto;
}

.card{
background:linear-gradient(145deg,#111,#1b1b1b);
padding:30px;
border-radius:25px;
text-align:center;
border:1px solid rgba(255,215,0,0.2);
transition:0.4s;
}

.card:hover{
transform:translateY(-10px);
box-shadow:0 0 25px rgba(255,215,0,0.2);
}

.final{
height:100vh;
display:flex;
justify-content:center;
align-items:center;
text-align:center;
padding:20px;
background:
linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.8),rgba(0,0,0,0.9)),
url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516589178581-6cd7833ae3b2?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop');
background-size:cover;
background-position:center;
}

.final h1{
font-size:4rem;
color:#ff1744;
text-shadow:0 0 25px #ff1744;
margin-bottom:20px;
}

.final p{
font-size:1.4rem;
color:#fff;
}

@keyframes fadeIn{
from{
opacity:0;
transform:translateY(20px);
}
to{
opacity:1;
transform:translateY(0);
}
}

@media(max-width:768px){

.hero h1{
font-size:2.5rem;
}

.final h1{
font-size:2.5rem;
}

.timeline::before{
left:10px;
}

.timeline-item{
width:100%;
padding-left:40px;
padding-right:0;
margin-bottom:20px;
text-align:left !important;
left:0 !important;
}

}

</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="hearts"></div>

<audio id="music" loop>
<source src="song.mp3" type="audio/mp3">
</audio>

<section class="hero">

<div class="hero-content">

<h1>Happy Birthday My Dear Mau ❤️</h1>

<p>
5 वर्ष... अनंत आठवणी...<br>
आणि माझ्या आयुष्यातील सर्वात सुंदर व्यक्ती म्हणजे तू 🌸
</p>

<button class="btn" onclick="startExperience()">
Open Your Surprise 🎁
</button>

</div>

</section>

<section class="section">

<h2 class="title">आपल्या आठवणी 📸</h2>

<div class="gallery">

<img src="1.jpg">
<img src="2.jpg">
<img src="3.jpg">
<img src="4.jpg">
<img src="5.jpg">

</div>

</section>

<section class="section">

<h2 class="title">माझ्याकडून तुझ्यासाठी 💌</h2>

<div class="letter">

माझ्या प्रिय Mau, ❤️<br><br>

गेली 5 वर्ष तू माझ्यासोबत आहेस हे माझं सर्वात मोठं भाग्य आहे...
तुझ्यासोबत असताना मला प्रत्येक गोष्ट सुंदर वाटते.
तुझं हसणं, तुझं बोलणं, तुझी काळजी... सगळंच माझ्यासाठी special आहे. <br><br>

कधी भांडण झाली, कधी रुसवेफुगवे झाले...
पण प्रत्येक वेळी आपलं प्रेम अजून मजबूत झालं. ♾️ <br><br>

तू फक्त माझी girlfriend नाहीस...
तू माझं peace आहेस, माझं comfort आहेस, माझं घर आहेस. ❤️ <br><br>

Happy Birthday Princess 👑<br>
मी कायम तुझ्यासोबत राहीन.<br>
I Love You Forever Mau ❤️

</div>

</section>

<section class="section">

<h2 class="title">आपला प्रवास ⏳</h2>

<div class="timeline">

<div class="timeline-item">
<div class="timeline-content">
❤️ पहिली भेट
</div>
</div>

<div class="timeline-item">
<div class="timeline-content">
🌸 पहिली long chat
</div>
</div>

<div class="timeline-item">
<div class="timeline-content">
😂 पहिलं भांडण
</div>
</div>

<div class="timeline-item">
<div class="timeline-content">
🤍 पहिली hug
</div>
</div>

<div class="timeline-item">
<div class="timeline-content">
♾️ 5 years together
</div>
</div>

</div>

</section>

<section class="section">

<h2 class="title">मी तुझ्यावर प्रेम का करतो ❤️</h2>

<div class="cards">

<div class="card">
तू माझी peace आहेस 🌸
</div>

<div class="card">
तुझं हसणं माझं favourite आहे 😭❤️
</div>

<div class="card">
तू असलीस की सगळं perfect वाटतं ✨
</div>

<div class="card">
तू माझ्या आयुष्यातली best person आहेस 👑
</div>

</div>

</section>

<section class="final">

<div>

<h1>I Love You Forever ❤️</h1>

<p>
Happy Birthday My Dear Mau 👑
</p>

</div>

</section>

<script>

function startExperience(){

document.getElementById("music").play();

window.scrollTo({
top:window.innerHeight,
behavior:'smooth'
});

}

function createHeart(){

const heart=document.createElement('div');

heart.classList.add('heart');

heart.innerHTML='❤';

heart.style.left=Math.random()*100+'vw';

heart.style.fontSize=Math.random()*20+15+'px';

heart.style.animationDuration=Math.random()*3+5+'s';

document.querySelector('.hearts').appendChild(heart);

setTimeout(()=>{
heart.remove();
},8000);

}

setInterval(createHeart,300);

</script>

</body>
</html>
